                    Our Statement of Faith
                </h2>
                <p class="text-sky-200/80 text-sm font-sans mt-3">
                    Uncompromising biblical foundations anchored in historic orthodox Christianity.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                
                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl azure-glass-shell border border-sky-400/25">
                    <span class="text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold">01</span>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Holy Scriptures</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-sky-200/80 font-sans leading-relaxed">
                        We believe the 66 books of the Bible are the inspired, infallible, and authoritative Word of God, serving as the supreme rule of faith and conduct (2 Timothy 3:16-17).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl azure-glass-shell border border-sky-400/25">
                    <span class="text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold">02</span>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Triune God</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-sky-200/80 font-sans leading-relaxed">
                        We believe in one eternal God, eternally existent in three co-equal persons: Father, Son, and Holy Spirit (Matthew 28:19; 2 Corinthians 13:14).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl azure-glass-shell border border-sky-400/25">
                    <span class="text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold">03</span>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Person of Jesus Christ</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-sky-200/80 font-sans leading-relaxed">
                        We believe in the deity and humanity of our Lord Jesus Christ, His virgin birth, sinless life, miracles, vicarious atonement on the cross, bodily resurrection, and imminent return (John 1:1-14).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl azure-glass-shell border border-sky-400/25">
                    <span class="text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold">04</span>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2">Salvation by Grace Alone</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-sky-200/80 font-sans leading-relaxed">
                        Salvation is a free gift received through repentance and personal faith in Jesus Christ alone, apart from human works, regenerating the believer by the Holy Spirit (Ephesians 2:8-9).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl azure-glass-shell border border-sky-400/25">
                    <span class="text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold">05</span>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Holy Spirit & Sanctification</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-sky-200/80 font-sans leading-relaxed">
                        We believe in the present ministry of the Holy Spirit who indwells believers, empowering them with spiritual gifts to live a holy life and witness boldly (Acts 1:8).
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl azure-glass-shell border border-sky-400/25">
                    <span class="text-cyan-300 font-mono text-xs font-bold">06</span>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold uppercase text-white mt-1 mb-2">The Church & The Great Commission</h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-sky-200/80 font-sans leading-relaxed">
                        The Church is the body of Christ called to corporate worship, ordinances of Baptism and the Lord's Supper, and proclaiming the Gospel to all nations (Matthew 28:19-20).
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

